# Lumen P19+ Hard Rules (Cursor auto-loaded)

> **This rule file is auto-loaded by Cursor whenever you work in the
> lumen repo.** It distills `~/workspace/lumen/CLAUDE.md` rules
> #10-#19 (P19+ rules) into a Cursor-friendly summary. For the
> full rationale and code examples, read `docs/PITFALLS.md` and
> `docs/P19-DESIGN.md`.

## When you start any new feature in lumen

1. **Re-read** `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` (tier diagram).
2. **Re-read** `docs/PITFALLS.md` §"Pre-flight" (5-step probe).
3. **Verify in tree first** — grep the package for the keyword
   before proposing "build X":
   ```bash
   grep -rn '<keyword>' packages/<pkg>/src/
   grep -rn '<keyword>' packages/<pkg>/test/
   grep -rn '<keyword>' apps/
   ```
4. **Compare 4 upstream frameworks before writing a new abstraction.**
   Fetch real docs (no memory citations):
   ```bash
   python3 ~/.hermes/skills/lumen-agent-framework/scripts/fetch-docs.py \
     https://blog.langchain.com/langchain-v1-0/ \
     https://langchain-ai.github.io/langgraph/concepts/ \
     https://openclaw.ai/blog/ \
     https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/claude-code/overview
   ```
   The user explicitly pushes back on "your solution is the best?"
   — without fetch evidence, do not claim a design is optimal.

## Hard rules (P19+)

5. **任何"对 Agent loop 的扩展" = middleware.** 禁止在
   `AgentConfig` 上堆 boolean flags（`enablePlan` /
   `enableReflection` / `enableSkill`）。改 loop → 写
   `AgentMiddleware`（interface + function，see
   `docs/P19-DESIGN.md` §1）。
6. **任何"对 Agent state 的语义" = Zod state schema.** 中间件
   state 必须是 Zod discriminated union，append-only。
7. **任何"对 Agent 入口的封装" = `createAgent` factory.** 不在
   `apps/cli/src/composition.ts` 手写 `new Agent({...})` 加一堆
   middleware。
8. **任何"抽象类只有 1 个实现" = 删除抽象，复用 Agent.** 例：
   `BaseSubAgent` / `SingleRunSubAgent` 在 P19.3 删除。继承链
   至少 ≥ 2 个非 wrapper 实现。
9. **helper function > abstract class.** `BasePlanner` /
   `BaseReflector` 抽象保留为 **interface**，但具体实现
   （`LLMPlanner` / `RuleBasedReflector`）改写为 **function**。
10. **ToolRisk 三档必须 enforce.** `Agent.dispatchToolCall`
    必须根据 `risk: 'safe' | 'approval-required' | 'dangerous'`
    决定 throw / ask user / 直接执行。`write_file` / `terminal`
    必须有 workspaceRoot 边界检查（`startsWith(workspaceRoot +
    path.sep)`，trailing `path.sep` 防 prefix bypass）。
11. **Sandbox cross-tool.** DefaultSandbox 路径检查必须覆盖
    fs 工具（write_file / patch / read_file），不只是 terminal。
12. **Reflection / Plan wire-up 才有价值.** P9.5 / P12.5 已
    export 的 `BasePlanner` / `LLMPlanner` / `PlanStore` /
    `RuleBasedReflector` / `LLMReflector` 都是 Agent.run 不调
    的孤儿。P19.1 / P19.2 commit 必须 wire up middleware，并
    至少 3 个 e2e。

## Code-pattern rules (lumen P0–P18 evolved)

13. **Zod discriminatedUnion + `.strict()`.** Tool input schema
    用 `z.discriminatedUnion('kind', [...])` + `.strict()`。
14. **`BaseTool.call` 边界 safeParse contract.** Tool 内部
    `call(input, ctx)` 第一行必须 `safeParse`，失败 throw
    `ValidationError({ toolName, issues })`。Tool 框架不再做
    safeParse 兜底。
15. **`process.env.X = undefined` 不要.** 用 `delete process.env.X`。
16. **`enum` vs `as const` object.** 避免 `enum`（TS anti-pattern），
    用 `as const` object。
17. **No try/catch that swallows.** Re-throw or convert to typed
    error (P9 typed error taxonomy: `ConfigError` /
    `ValidationError` / `ProviderError` / `ToolError` / `AbortError`).
18. **No `any` in committed code.** `unknown` is fine; narrow it.
19. **Tests required for every new function.** ≥ 80% line coverage
    on the file you changed.

## Tooling gotchas (lumen-side)

- **better-sqlite3 ABI mismatch**: rebuild from repo root AND
  `cd packages/memory && pnpm rebuild better-sqlite3`. Wait for
  `gyp info ok`. Triggered by biome `--write` on package.json
  followed by `pnpm install`.
- **`pnpm exec` 不在 root 跑** for `vitest` / `tsx` /
  `biome`. Use `cd packages/<pkg>` or `pnpm --filter <pkg> exec`
  or `pnpm --filter <pkg> test`. (Biome is OK at root as it is
  a root devDep.)
- **pnpm add 无 `--dry-run`.** Use `--lockfile-only` for safe
  preview.
- **macOS 沙箱无 `timeout` 命令.** Use `AbortController`, not
  `child_process.exec('timeout 30 cmd')`.
- **LSP cache lag.** Always verify with
  `pnpm --filter <pkg> typecheck`, not LSP.

## Tier isolation (forbidden imports)

| From | May import | Forbidden |
|---|---|---|
| `packages/config` | (none) | All other Lumen packages |
| `packages/core` | `packages/config` | `packages/llm`, `packages/tools`, `packages/memory`, `packages/skills`, `packages/mcp` |
| `packages/llm` | `packages/core`, `packages/config` | `packages/tools`, `packages/memory`, `packages/skills`, `packages/mcp` |
| `packages/tools` | `packages/core`, `packages/config` | `packages/llm`, `packages/memory`, `packages/skills`, `packages/mcp` |
| `packages/memory` | `packages/core`, `packages/config` | `packages/llm`, `packages/tools`, `packages/skills`, `packages/mcp` |
| `packages/skills` | `packages/core`, `packages/config` | `packages/llm`, `packages/tools`, `packages/memory`, `packages/mcp` |
| `packages/mcp` | `packages/core`, `packages/config` | `packages/llm`, `packages/tools`, `packages/memory`, `packages/skills` |
| `apps/cli` (Tier 3) | Everything | (none) |

For P19+ sub-agent / plan / reflection, the DI pattern is:
`AgentConfig.{planner?, reflector?, metaReflector?}` — the
caller injects the implementation; core never imports memory.

## Anti-patterns to avoid (P19 audit 6 questions)

- **declared-but-not-enforced**: ToolRisk / PlanStore /
  SkillTrigger 字段 export 但不查。
- **wrapper-class / abstract-base-with-one-impl**:
  `BaseSubAgent` / `SingleRunSubAgent` 是教科书反例。
- **cross-tier import**: core import memory（Build 会 fail，
  IDE 不报警）。
- **boolean flag soup in AgentConfig**: 用 middleware 替代。

